;
; How Tributary files one source of an answer in MYRA (tributary_rules.h
; TB7): a tree under the question's number and the model's place among
; the sources asked, holding the answer's normalised code and the time it
; came, ms since 1970. The model asks whether the numbers fit before it
; keeps the answer.
^ZXTRIB(question:i9, model:i2) = code:i9! ^ stamp:i15!
